Description: Enterprise-grade automatic downloads folder organizer
 Smart Downloads Organizer watches your Downloads folder (and any other
 configured paths) in real time using Linux inotify and automatically
 sorts, categorizes, deduplicates, and cleans up incoming files using
 a fully configurable rule engine.
 .
 Features:
  * Real-time inotify-based file watching with zero polling overhead
  * Auto-categorization of 200+ file extensions into 12 categories
  * SHA-256 duplicate detection with one-click cleanup
  * Configurable rule engine: extension, name, size, age, MIME, regex
  * Full undo history for every file operation
  * Cleanup suggestions for large, old, and duplicate files
  * Simulation (dry-run) mode to preview changes
  * Headless/daemon mode for servers and background operation
  * Persistent SQLite database with full-text search
  * Dark-themed GTK3 interface
